{"seq":3,"slug":"education-systems","title":"教育体系","docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"education-system-models","title":"教育体系模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-systems/education-system-models","wordCount":1850,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"comparative-education","title":"比较教育学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-systems/comparative-education","wordCount":2068,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"education-policy-reform","title":"教育政策与改革","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-systems/education-policy-reform","wordCount":1997,"readingTime":8},{"seq":4,"slug":"global-education-systems","title":"各国教育体制比较","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-systems/global-education-systems","wordCount":1812,"readingTime":8},{"seq":5,"slug":"k12-higher-education","title":"K-12 与高等教育","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-systems/k12-higher-education","wordCount":1992,"readingTime":8},{"seq":6,"slug":"lifelong-informal-education","title":"终身学习与非正式教育","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-systems/lifelong-informal-education","wordCount":1938,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 教育体系 简介\n\n本章从宏观制度和政策视角审视教育系统的结构与运行。教育体系是社会的基础性制度安排，不同国家的教育体系在组织形式、治理模式和资源配置上存在显著差异。理解这些差异有助于在全球化背景下进行教育产品和服务的设计。\n\n**教育体系模型**介绍全球主要教育体系的组织模型，分析学段划分、学制设计和教育治理结构等核心要素。\n\n**比较教育学**探讨不同国家和地区教育体系的比较分析方法，帮助读者理解各国教育改革的经验教训和可借鉴之处。\n\n**教育政策与改革**讲解教育政策的制定过程和主要改革方向，涵盖教育公平、质量提升和教育治理现代化等当代核心议题。\n\n建议读者在掌握教育哲学和学习理论的基础上学习本章，将微观的教学理论与宏观的制度设计相结合。\n"}